### Simplified Example
To achieve the same functionality without obfuscation:
```javascript
function isSublist(mainList, subList) {
  if (subList.length === 0) return true;
  if (subList.length > mainList.length) return false;

  for (let i = 0; i <= mainList.length - subList.length; i++) {
